From: Byron Lee <byronlee@google.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Dec 2025 04:26:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Reland "Add the ability to use do base64 encoding in
 //base with simdutf""

This reverts commit 040edfd78675fe5eab8335723a6601a71ccca8df.
---
